id: pm-github-s6xa
title: Reconcile imported GitHub assignees with strict tracker ownership
description: A strict tracker can refuse source lifecycle finalization or an update after a GitHub assignee is mapped to a different ownership principal. Reproduced with a synthetic assigned issue and PM CLI 2026.11.17 while verifying progressive creation. Preserve local ownership enforcement and determine how source assignment should be represented on importer-owned mirrors.
